25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems the human element is shifting; we have plenty of coders now, but the phenotyping experts have vanished into industry.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I've noticed that while some costs are rising, the ministry is still helping us with glasshouse subsidies.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Oh no! The spectroscopy suite was broken for eleven weeks! But the animal facility is doing great with new vet cover.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears that field sites are quite volatile due to weather, while computational risks are much more manageable.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The data suggests that broad catalogues have a much longer shelf life than specific mechanism studies.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,A sobering thought. We must ensure the project we pick has the actual hands to do the work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I also found that computing hours are currently free under the national agreement, which is a wonderful relief.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the glasshouses, though. They are completely booked up for the next two cycles!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, and those relying on live breeding colonies seem to suffer the most frequent delays.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"The repository turnaround has improved significantly, which favors projects with high data output.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
